# TransitFlow — root env template
#
# This file is documentation. The real env files live next to each component:
#
#   server/.env        ← copy from server/.env.example  (API: key, Redis, CORS)
#   web/.env.local     ← NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE=http://localhost:4000
#   android/           ← no env file needed; set API_BASE_URL in gradle.properties
#                        (or change it at runtime in the app: Profile → Server)
#
# Production checklist:
#   1. Render (API):     GEMINI_API_KEY=…  REDIS_URL=…  CORS_ORIGINS=https://<web>.vercel.app
#   2. Vercel (web):     NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE=https://<api>.onrender.com
#   3. Android:          Profile → Server → https://<api>.onrender.com  (or -PAPI_BASE_URL=…)
